# `out/` is deliberately NOT ignored: it is the built front end FastAPI serves,
# and committing it is what lets this app run with only Python installed. It is
# a build artifact — regenerate it with `npm run build` whenever the front end
# changes, and commit the result alongside the source change. That is a
# developer step; nobody running Jarvis ever builds anything.
